    "careers-f-thanks": "Thank you, your application is on its way. A real person will read it and email you back. While our secure intake finishes coming online, your email app may open so you can send your details and attach your resume to careers@levoila.org.",
    "careers-f-privacy": "We collect this only to consider you for a role. Your information is encrypted, never sold, and you can ask us to delete it anytime. We never ask for bank details or ID numbers here. See our Privacy Policy.",
    "careers-next-eyebrow": "WHAT HAPPENS NEXT",
    "careers-next-1": "A real person reviews your application, usually within a week.",
    "careers-next-2": "For paid and steward roles, we set up a conversation. For most volunteer roles, we move straight to scheduling.",
    "careers-next-3": "If it's a fit, our HR guide walks you through onboarding step by step, in your language.",
