    "team-role-cos": "CHIEF OF STAFF",
    "team-cos-bio": "Runs the Founder's office and keeps the trust moving across every team, heritage, field ops, stewardship, finance, communications. The desk where partners, press, and Stewards reach Levoila when something needs to happen.",
